    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "From what I saw the state is an instance of `SearchParameters` and it's always constructed the same way, so it the keys are always in the same order.\r\n\r\nFor lodash, I though we were in the process of removing it from our dependencies?",
