    "body": "> We're in the process of removing Lodash in the JavaScript helper, not in InstantSearch.js (not even sure we plan this).\r\n\r\nWell it seems logical to me to remove it from InstantSearch.js after the helper :wink:\r\n\r\n> Even if we were to remove Lodash, I think it's safer to use it here since we already often rely on their isEqual util function. We can still later think of creating our own isEqual util and replacing the import.\r\n\r\nI'm ok with that :slightly_smiling_face: ",
